99100978751/", "num_games_owned": 53, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 76, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 76, "last_played": 1767031519, "avatar": "ff3b4ea4bc6a79a32491db38f22ad8188c82ce90"}, "language": "english", "review": "I dont understand\n\nI dont understand why this game has overly negative reviews. Sure i didnt play for long, however it catched me when i was playin. The levels are really short and you want to play more and more: 30 minutes in and i´ve got the Asuka Langley skin and the latest hero which is needed to play her without paying anything.\n\nthe only downside is that its too ez which is normal because you get a lot of good gear from active events.\nI´d reccomend this game for everyone who wants a fast shooter experience\n\nMaybe i will change my review when i´ve collected more experience but for now its a 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1767049701, "timestamp_updated": 1767049701, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214578378", "author": {"steamid": "76561199055230673", "personaname": "Kustik_Love", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199055230673/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3503, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3503, "last_played": 1767039568, "avatar": "3a8cb912b1deb3e30b98d333ece5c72e0fb7d24e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Terminull Brigade is a fun game, approximately for first 60 hours or so. My experience went somewhat well? I mean developers are sweet, I get to play fun modes with my favourite anime character + got some friends who boosted me to get better gear. And here I am, catching myself in a state of finally finding the game I love to play... although THE AMOUNT OF CONTENT FOR LATE GAME IS MISERABLE. \n\nYou get to fight absolutely the same  bosses with same repeating mechanics (the game having around 15 different bosses does not help). You literally grind for miserable rewards something that is not even fun to grind. Also the amount of orbs or whatever there is for gacha of skins is nothing. I'd get it if there was way to get them f2p, but there ain't (skins give grinding bonus and look nice, so I'd love to get at least one). \n\nOnce there's more content for late-game, I'd give positive review, but the state game is in now could be described via this model.\n\nNew player comes - new player enjoys - new player spends money - new player becomes old player - old player is bored.", "timestamp_created": 1767041210, "timestamp_updated": 1767041210, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.569718539714813232", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "214544166", "author": {"steamid": "76561199858316577", "personaname": "NamAdversar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199858316577/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 15, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15, "last_played": 1767016716, "avatar": "84410e5bd7bf82d7787b34f463dc46dcc6773d71"}, "language": "english", "review": "Another bloat/spyware. Just run it for 15min in the first screen without agreeing to the ToS, get your orbs and uninstall.", "timestamp_created": 1767016755, "timestamp_updated": 1767016755, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496913939714431763", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_f