um_games_owned": 706, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 240, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 196, "last_played": 1766745532, "avatar": "0690545b2a7fc94f5c4750608744cb1495601b20"}, "language": "english", "review": "This games good - despite all the negative reviews. I'm not far in but it is a little on the easier side so far, and the stuttering is real - devs have aknowledged the issue and seem to understand its a server issue so fingers crossed they find a solution soon enough.\n\nThe spyware stuff is nonsense - people claiming that it's trying at access the Runescape launcher don't know how to check what's going on. It asks for admin to access its own launcher, which is unfortunately names \"rs_launcher.exe\". If you actually look at the details you can see that it is their own launcher inside of their own directory. \n\nOtherwise the game looks good, plays good (besides the stuttering) and has a lot of potential if they embrace some endless type game modes with the rougelike mechanics. You can buy the characters but I've been given 3 for free already, otherwise the microtransactions are just skins. \n\nPlus, the Evangelion collab is dope.", "timestamp_created": 1766743225, "timestamp_updated": 1766743225, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.584905624389648438", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214226305", "author": {"steamid": "76561198357877210", "personaname": "VI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/veziel/", "num_games_owned": 901, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 16, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16, "last_played": 1766742904, "avatar": "83312855e2f886d597c3e1a7f39049e5519a93a8"}, "language": "english", "review": "install, start, w